# Thin Shell — generated bootstrap inventory

Phase **4bj** locks what remains under `apps/web/src/bootstrap/*.generated.ts` after product binder retirement.

## Inventory (exact set)

### TypeScript registries (`*.generated.ts`)

| File | Role | Product imports | Retire? |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `workspace-plugin-loaders.generated.ts` | Opaque `pluginId` → dynamic `import(…/plugin)` + `getWorkspacePlugin()` | Dynamic only | **No** — plan §2.4 registry |
| `workspace-theme-stylesheets.generated.ts` | Theme CSS loaders by plugin id | Dynamic only | **No** — registry |
| `workspace-wizard-message-loads.generated.ts` | Wizard message JSON loaders by namespace | Dynamic only | **No** — registry |
| `workspace-owner-settings-panel-loaders.generated.ts` | Owner settings panel loaders | Dynamic only | **No** — registry |
| `wizard-media-route-bindings.generated.ts` | Opaque `mediaRouteKey` → BFF path | None | **No** — §2.4 opaque table |
| `wizard-media-backend-route-bindings.generated.ts` | Opaque `mediaRouteKey` → API paths | None | **No** — §2.4 opaque table |
| `wizard-i18n-translator-hooks.generated.ts` | Namespace allowlist (`is`/`list` only) | None | **No** — Phase 4bh slim |

### Next / tooling support (not product binders)

| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `admin-transpile-packages.generated.mjs` | `transpilePackages` list for `next.config.ts` |
| `admin-client-workspace-ignore.generated.mjs` | IgnorePlugin rules + `ALLOW_*` gates |
| `workspace-theme-css-modules.generated.d.ts` | Ambient CSS module types |

Any **new** product binder (`*bindings*.generated.ts` membership/ensure maps) requires a Thin Shell charter phase + architecture test update.

## Guards

- `guard:thin-shell` — non-generated product imports = 0; generated static product import lines = 0
- `apps/web/test/thin-shell-generated-bootstrap-inventory.spec.ts` — exact file set + role contracts

